### 测试全局异常处理

### 1. 正常查询
GET http://localhost:8080/products/1

### 2. 查询不存在的商品 — 应返回 {"code":404, "message":"商品不存在"}
GET http://localhost:8080/products/999

### 3. 路径参数类型错误 — 应返回 {"code":400, "message":"参数类型错误：id"}
GET http://localhost:8080/products/abc

### 4. 正常创建
POST http://localhost:8080/products
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "AirPods Pro", "price": 1899.00, "stock": 200}

### 5. 校验失败：名称为空 — 应返回 {"code":400, "message":"商品名称不能为空"}
POST http://localhost:8080/products
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "", "price": 1899.00, "stock": 200}

### 6. 校验失败：价格为负 — 应返回 {"code":400, "message":"价格必须大于0"}
POST http://localhost:8080/products
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "测试商品", "price": -100, "stock": 200}

### 7. 校验失败：缺少必填字段 — 应返回 {"code":400, ...}
POST http://localhost:8080/products
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "测试商品"}

### 8. 查询全部
GET http://localhost:8080/products
